  {
   "id": "super-woden-gp-2-225189@1.25",
   "gameId": "super-woden-gp-2-225189",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.25",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-24T10:49:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Driver names can now be customized. It is very simple.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Access \\Super Woden GP 2_Data\\StreamingAssets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.Rename the file \"_pilot_names.txt\" to \"pilot_names.txt\". Simply remove the \"_\" character.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.Edit the file with notepad or any simple text editing program.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.It is very important to respect the structure of the lines of text. The last field is the the Drivers nationality (flag). This is the official 2-letter code of each country. For reference: link",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Loading times have been improved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Added additional confirmation on loading screens where gameplay tips appear",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
