  {
   "id": "super-woden-gp-2-225189@major-2024-03-05",
   "gameId": "super-woden-gp-2-225189",
   "displayName": "Custom skins Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-05T10:22:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.23. Custom skins Update",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It is now possible to create jpg files with custom paints for some vehicles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Instructions",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Access to GAME FOLDER/Super Woden GP 2_Data\\StreamingAssets\\CAR_SKINS, then open the desired brand and model folder. In Photoshop, Paint_dot_net, or any program of your choice, create a 1024x1024 image (preferably).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. You can add the bounds or base layers to have a reference on how to paint the new skin, these files are included for each car in the respective folder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Save the skin as a jpg (preferably) or png file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The file name must be the skin number. For example, it would be 1.jpg for the first skin, 2.jpg for the second, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. You can check the results almost in real time, saving the file and changing the skin, for example on the dealer screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6 .If you want to go back to the original skin, just delete the file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "At the moment it is not possible to add a greater number of skins than the ones the car originally has. They can only be replaced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I will work so that possibly in the future they can also be modified and add more skins than the ones that the car originally comes with.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Feel free to share your creations!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
